चमरिक, अस्, m. a kind of ebony, Bauhinia
Variegata, growing in clusters resembling a chowrie;
[cf. कोविदार.]

चाम्पेय चाम्पेय, अस्, m. (fr. चम्पा), N. of
two trees, Michelia Champaka and Mesua Ferrea;
a stamen or filament, especially of the lotus flower;
a prince of Campā; N. of a son of Viśvā-mitra;
(अस्, अम्), m. n. gold.
